  "description": "High performance, low price\nHowever you ride, Whyte Secta S will help unlock your riding potential in a fun, capable and confidence-inspiring package. Blending progressive geometry, specially curated components and full weatherproofing for the best possible performance and value combination, Whyte Secta S is a proper real-world, modern mountain bike that’s trail-ready right from the shop floor.\n\nHighlights\n– Fully featured 6061 T6 precision formed aluminium frame.\n– 130mm RockShox Rekon Silver RL suspension fork.\n– Capable, smooth-rolling 29er wheels + Maxxis tyres.\n– Shimano Cues 1x10 transmission (30T chainring x 11-48 cassette).\n– Tektro two-piston hydraulic disc brakes (180mm rotors front + rear)\n– TransX full-insertion dropper post (with frame size-specific drop).",
